WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.208
A business without customers is only a hobby. Know who you serve.

00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:08.930
Describe who your customers are, and where they buy now.

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:15.033
Find out what matters most: price, quality, speed, or being close by.

00:00:15.580 --> 00:00:19.032
Talk to at least ten real people about their problem.

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:22.614
And keep asking for feedback after you start selling.

00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:33.131
Before you move on, check: Write a short customer description. Talk to ten possible customers. Note what they pay now. Ask one customer for feedback.

00:00:33.880 --> 00:00:36.705
In the next lesson: Costs and pricing.
